[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the vehicle on a lift\nand raise.</p><p>1. Undo the bolts securing the shield.</p><p>2. Remove the shield.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019500.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the shield is undamaged.</p><p>Refit the shield and tighten the retaining\nbolts.</p><p>Remove the vehicle from the lift.</p>"]]